            ("system_health_backup_repair","Full System Health Check, Backup & Safe Repair","Combines Run Health Check → Run Full Diagnostics → Phase 0 Self-Test → V25 Static Integrity Check → Phase 0 Core Library Audit → Portable Metadata Backup → Repair Safe Issues → final health verification.","Yes — diagnostics plus backup and safe metadata/folder/CSV repairs.","Normal comprehensive health/repair operation."),
            ("recovery_db","Build Recovery DB from Folders","Builds a recovery SQLite database from physical VIDEO_ID folders/markers without replacing the current DB.","Yes — creates recovery DB.","For targeted DB recovery."),
