            ("clean_temp_resolved_empty","Clean Temporary, Resolved & Empty Files/Folders","Combines Classify Old tmp → Clean Resolved tmp → Clean All Empty Folders. Clean All Empty Folders already includes Clean Empty Staging, Remove Empty Legacy ChatGPT Folders and all empty library folders, so legacy actions are not run twice.","Yes — moves temporary artifacts and removes only truly empty folders.","After retries/migrations/download cleanup."),
